---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Get Involved"
  description="Join Pune Animal Liberation and help us fight for animal rights in Pune, India."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-header__title">Get Involved</h1>
      <p class="page-header__subtitle">Take action for animals today</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-page">
    <h2>Come to an Outreach Event</h2>
    <p>
      The most powerful thing you can do is show up. PAL holds regular street outreach sessions
      across Pune, where we meet the public, share information, and have meaningful conversations
      about animal rights. No experience necessary — we'll train you.
    </p>
    <a href="/events/" class="btn btn--primary">View Upcoming Events</a>

    <h2>Go Vegan</h2>
    <p>
      The single most impactful personal change you can make is to adopt a vegan lifestyle. Every
      meal is a choice that affects animals, the planet, and public health. We're here to help you
      make that transition.
    </p>
    <a href="/resources/" class="btn btn--green">Vegan Resources</a>

    <h2>Volunteer With Us</h2>
    <p>PAL is run entirely by volunteers. We need help with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Street outreach and leafleting</li>
      <li>Photography and videography at events</li>
      <li>Social media and content creation</li>
      <li>Event planning and coordination</li>
      <li>Translation (Marathi, Hindi, English)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Spread the Word</h2>
    <p>
      Share PAL content with your friends and family. Talk about animal rights in your communities.
      Encourage those around you to question the status quo. Every conversation matters.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Ready to get involved? Reach out and we'll connect you with the right people.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">Get in Touch</a>
  </div>
</Layout>
